{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53941","headline":"七言美瓜沙僧献款诗二首 二 · 宗茝","name":"七言美瓜沙僧献款诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行尽平沙入汉川，手摇金锡意朝天。\n如今政是无爲代，尧舜聪明莫比肩。\n（同前。\n原署：「右街千福寺内道场表白兼应制赐紫大德宗茝。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗茝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}